WEBVTT

01:41.893 --> 01:44.521
Baki, that was the last time.

01:45.188 --> 01:46.856
<i>He knows I'm lying.</i>

01:47.357 --> 01:49.150
You held back.

01:49.651 --> 01:53.780
I've also held back
in response to your insult.

01:53.863 --> 01:57.534
<i>I have to show him
the real me deep inside...</i>

01:58.743 --> 02:00.537
Come on, Baki.

02:00.620 --> 02:03.164
Enough already.

02:03.248 --> 02:07.043
Show your father your true skill.

02:08.711 --> 02:10.755
Let's do this for real.

02:11.714 --> 02:12.799
All right?

02:21.391 --> 02:23.810
I see right through you, Baki.

02:25.270 --> 02:27.397
Hurry up and show me what you got.

02:27.480 --> 02:28.648
Come on.

02:28.731 --> 02:31.568
<i>It figures. Of course he sees through me.</i>

02:32.652 --> 02:34.571
<i>All my progress to get to this point.</i>

02:35.530 --> 02:38.116
<i>My growth. My evolution.</i>

02:40.285 --> 02:42.829
<i>I'm sure he's seen through it all.</i>

02:44.164 --> 02:46.332
All right, Pop.

02:48.751 --> 02:49.627
<i>Relax.</i>

02:51.212 --> 02:52.255
<i>Relax.</i>

02:53.798 --> 02:54.924
<i>My muscles.</i>

02:55.925 --> 02:58.219
<i>All my joints.</i>

02:59.971 --> 03:00.930
<i>My organs.</i>

03:03.224 --> 03:05.602
<i>Even the moisture in my body.</i>

03:08.271 --> 03:11.107
<i>Only then can I manifest</i>

03:11.983 --> 03:14.152
<i>that unbelievable speed.</i>

03:15.445 --> 03:19.115
<i>Only that organism,
my teacher, is capable of producing</i>

03:20.200 --> 03:22.869
<i>an initial velocity
equivalent to its top speed!</i>

03:23.453 --> 03:26.748
I can hardly wait. I just wanna hug you.

03:28.458 --> 03:30.376
Don't stop!

03:31.961 --> 03:33.963
Relax.

03:34.714 --> 03:36.382
Relax.

03:37.926 --> 03:40.386
<i>A flaccidity that exceeds all flaccidity.</i>

03:42.013 --> 03:45.892
<i>Melt even the remaining
subconscious stiffness of muscle fibers.</i>

03:47.060 --> 03:51.314
<i>In the young man's mind,
his muscle fibers were no longer fibers</i>

03:52.774 --> 03:53.983
<i>but turning into liquid.</i>

03:55.610 --> 03:58.446
<i>He further imagined the liquid vaporizing.</i>

03:59.989 --> 04:03.326
<i>Ultra-flaccid.</i>

04:06.996 --> 04:07.997
<i>Now!</i>

04:08.623 --> 04:13.920
<i>He has actualized that max start velocity
only the cockroach is capable of.</i>

04:18.007 --> 04:20.218
<i>How's this, Father?</i>

04:20.301 --> 04:24.889
<i>This 270-kph move
that your son has developed,</i>

04:25.515 --> 04:27.475
<i>the "Cockroach Tackle"!</i>

04:54.210 --> 04:58.047
<i>Kicking off countless shards
of glass, bare-footed,</i>

04:58.131 --> 05:00.967
<i>but not a single drop of blood shed.</i>

05:01.050 --> 05:02.969
<i>That's no ordinary training...</i>

05:27.285 --> 05:28.995
What's this?

05:42.008 --> 05:43.468
Where did you learn this?

05:44.761 --> 05:46.637
Turning your muscle fibers to liquid,

05:46.721 --> 05:49.515
further relaxing them into vapor,

05:51.100 --> 05:53.728
then tensing them a moment later.

05:55.104 --> 05:59.901
The explosive power generated
greatly exceeds my expectations.

06:01.736 --> 06:04.614
<i>In the past, many competitors
and martial artists</i>

06:05.114 --> 06:08.576
have attempted
this difficult act of relaxing,

06:08.659 --> 06:12.538
but in actuality could never achieve
relaxing to the liquid level.

06:14.540 --> 06:17.794
Where did you learn this skill?

06:18.544 --> 06:20.380
Who taught you?

06:22.382 --> 06:23.299
Who's your teacher?

06:33.059 --> 06:33.893
Baki.

06:35.686 --> 06:37.313
You've got an excellent teacher.

06:49.075 --> 06:50.326
<i>There is an urban legend.</i>

06:52.161 --> 06:54.205
<i>The legend
of the strongest father and son.</i>

06:56.124 --> 07:00.670
<i>In a certain location beneath Tokyo,
there exists a secret battle arena.</i>

07:02.213 --> 07:06.342
<i>Fighters, martial artists,
and competitors gather there</i>

07:07.593 --> 07:10.096
<i>to determine the strongest
among the strong.</i>

07:11.305 --> 07:13.182
<i>The rules could not be simpler.</i>

07:13.850 --> 07:15.893
<i>Fight bare-fisted. That is all.</i>

07:16.936 --> 07:18.855
<i>Crotch shots, eye pokes,</i>

07:19.605 --> 07:22.859
<i>and even biting are all legal.</i>

07:24.110 --> 07:27.363
<i>The reigning champion
of this rigorous competition is,</i>

07:28.698 --> 07:32.201
<i>unbelievably, a 17-year-old young man.</i>

07:34.120 --> 07:38.458
<i>But the man who frightens
this strongest of young men is, yes,</i>

07:39.959 --> 07:41.294
<i>his father.</i>

07:43.963 --> 07:46.841
<i>He defeated people,
slaughtered other species,</i>

07:48.176 --> 07:51.637
<i>overcame weapons,
destroyed armaments, and, ultimately,</i>

07:52.388 --> 07:55.933
<i>conquered the powerful,
and made military powers fear him.</i>

07:56.017 --> 07:58.311
<i>Made authorities treat him with care.</i>

07:58.811 --> 08:03.441
<i>This man had taken the possibilities
of raw strength to its extreme.</i>

08:04.400 --> 08:07.153
<i>This is how the urban legend continues.</i>

08:08.946 --> 08:11.782
<i>Lately, things have been
dangerously tense between these two.</i>

08:12.575 --> 08:16.287
<i>Young men latched onto
this underground information.</i>

08:16.370 --> 08:17.705
QUARTERLY URBAN LEGENDS

08:20.708 --> 08:23.711
<i>Even this man can be surprised at times.</i>

08:24.337 --> 08:25.171
What?

08:30.259 --> 08:31.761
What's with all the commotion?

08:32.303 --> 08:34.305
Oh! It's Ogre!

08:35.806 --> 08:37.683
- Oh, there he is!
- Is that really him?

08:42.522 --> 08:44.732
What?! Awesome!

08:45.983 --> 08:48.236
Shit, this sucks.

08:56.702 --> 08:58.371
<i>The moment he sprang to his feet...</i>

08:58.454 --> 09:00.623
Wow!

09:10.841 --> 09:13.594
Awesome! Hey! There he is!

09:16.013 --> 09:16.973
Is that Baki?

09:17.473 --> 09:20.226
- Baki!
<i>-</i> What?

09:20.726 --> 09:21.978
Where's your father?

09:22.979 --> 09:24.397
Oh! It's Ogre!

09:25.982 --> 09:27.400
- There he is!
- There he is!

09:33.489 --> 09:37.451
<i>It all started with a single news program.</i>

09:38.244 --> 09:41.414
<i>We have just received
a breaking news report.</i>

09:41.998 --> 09:44.750
<i>The Park Hilton in Shinjuku, Tokyo,</i>

09:44.834 --> 09:48.421
<i>has been cordoned off
by the riot police and Self-Defense Force.</i>

09:48.504 --> 09:51.424
<i>Amazingly, the reason for this is...</i>

09:53.217 --> 09:57.430
<i>apparently a father-son fight
between just one father and son.</i>

09:58.598 --> 09:59.682
<i>Mr. Kasuga.</i>

09:59.765 --> 10:01.183
<i>Just look at that!</i>

10:01.267 --> 10:04.312
<i>The shape is unrecognizable,
but that is a car.</i>

10:04.395 --> 10:08.274
<i>What's most amazing is that it's the car
exclusive to the Prime Minister.</i>

10:08.357 --> 10:09.442
<i>The Prime Minister?!</i>

10:10.109 --> 10:12.361
<i>Was there an accident or some incident?</i>

10:12.445 --> 10:13.446
<i>They fell on it!</i>

10:14.071 --> 10:17.450
<i>During their father-son fight,
they fell on it from the top of the hotel.</i>

10:18.034 --> 10:21.078
<i>The hotel has been cordoned off,
a car has been destroyed,</i>

10:21.162 --> 10:23.205
<i>and the Self-Defense Force
has been deployed.</i>

10:24.165 --> 10:26.542
<i>They must be
quite an incredible father and son.</i>

10:27.168 --> 10:28.044
<i>They realized.</i>

10:29.337 --> 10:33.007
<i>They realized it here,
and there, and there too.</i>

10:34.216 --> 10:35.968
<i>"I know this father and son!"</i>

10:36.052 --> 10:37.053
QUARTERLY URBAN LEGEND

10:37.136 --> 10:38.971
<i>"That rumor, that father and son..."</i>

10:40.598 --> 10:42.183
<i>"Their fight has begun!"</i>

10:44.477 --> 10:45.978
<i>"I can still make it."</i>

10:46.062 --> 10:47.313
<i>"I can make it."</i>

10:48.689 --> 10:49.523
<i>"I can make it."</i>

10:51.150 --> 10:52.902
<i>"If I leave now, I can make it!"</i>

10:55.446 --> 10:56.530
Baki!

10:57.323 --> 10:58.991
The strongest in the world!

11:04.455 --> 11:07.375
This isn't an exhibition, but...

11:13.798 --> 11:16.509
<i>This was something sudden and unexpected.</i>

11:17.009 --> 11:20.513
<i>It was an unimaginably enormous crowd
of unfathomable size.</i>

11:20.596 --> 11:24.308
Who the hell called these people here?!

11:25.184 --> 11:27.978
<i>Even for Yujiro, with his keen intellect,</i>

11:28.062 --> 11:30.523
<i>this incident was beyond imagination.</i>

11:31.649 --> 11:34.527
<i>What's more, the closest station
was packed with people.</i>

11:35.319 --> 11:38.114
<i>The crowd of onlookers
was certain to keep growing.</i>

11:39.198 --> 11:43.160
<i>Naturally, it wasn't the first time
he had fought in front of people.</i>

11:43.703 --> 11:47.623
<i>But this atmosphere felt so foreign.</i>

12:04.140 --> 12:06.517
The strongest father and son
are facing off!

12:07.059 --> 12:08.561
Just how strong are they?

12:09.895 --> 12:12.815
Hey, let's get outta here.
That's it today.

12:13.399 --> 12:14.442
I'm not stopping.

12:15.401 --> 12:16.610
What?

12:17.153 --> 12:19.321
Isn't this what you mean, Dad?

12:21.407 --> 12:24.702
"I'm too ashamed to make
a blunder in front of people."

12:24.785 --> 12:27.580
"Why don't we put this off for now?"

12:28.456 --> 12:29.582
Right?

12:33.669 --> 12:36.922
Have you gone mad, my son?

12:40.342 --> 12:42.303
<i>The eyes of the naive crowd</i>

12:42.803 --> 12:47.183
<i>were unable to see any of the young man's
three consecutive strikes.</i>

12:48.350 --> 12:50.686
<i>But the naked eye
was somehow able to capture...</i>

12:53.147 --> 12:57.610
<i>the moments after the dust raised
by his dash had begun to settle.</i>

13:00.196 --> 13:01.697
- What was that?
- It made a boom.

13:01.781 --> 13:03.449
He suddenly appeared up in the air.

13:03.532 --> 13:05.117
Then there was a "bang."

13:05.201 --> 13:06.202
I didn't see a thing.

13:11.582 --> 13:15.377
<i>Just like the young man,
they were still learning.</i>

13:15.461 --> 13:16.629
Who's gonna initiate?

13:16.712 --> 13:17.963
Ogre, for sure!

13:18.047 --> 13:19.507
No, it'll be Baki!

13:19.590 --> 13:20.883
It's already started.

13:22.009 --> 13:24.136
It already started long ago.

13:26.055 --> 13:27.181
That's right.

13:27.848 --> 13:30.142
That's how it is between two experts.

13:30.226 --> 13:32.561
It started the moment they faced off.

13:33.354 --> 13:34.522
I see.

13:37.608 --> 13:40.653
I see. That's what I taught you.

13:41.987 --> 13:44.490
A fight cannot be ended by one side alone.

13:45.324 --> 13:48.577
Both sides must agree before it can occur.

13:49.161 --> 13:52.164
Once punches are thrown,
doesn't matter whether you like it or not.

13:53.040 --> 13:55.751
There's no choice
but to engage and attack.

14:00.381 --> 14:04.176
I can't remember the last time
I've bled at the hands of someone else.

14:07.096 --> 14:11.559
When faced with danger,
you must overcome it on your own.

14:13.769 --> 14:15.938
<i>My respect for him was behind</i>

14:16.021 --> 14:18.190
<i>the three clear strikes
to his vital areas.</i>

14:19.108 --> 14:22.027
<i>But look at him.
He isn't the least bit shaken.</i>

14:22.820 --> 14:24.196
<i>Did I even hit him?</i>

14:25.030 --> 14:26.949
<i>Or did he just let me hit him?</i>

14:29.702 --> 14:30.911
<i>Either way,</i>

14:32.037 --> 14:33.914
<i>I've got no choice but to go for it.</i>

14:36.458 --> 14:39.628
<i>Relax. Melt.</i>

14:41.046 --> 14:43.465
<i>Turn my mind... to water.</i>

14:46.260 --> 14:48.470
<i>Yeah, that's about right.</i>

14:56.061 --> 14:57.187
<i>I wasn't able to move!</i>

14:58.063 --> 14:59.481
<i>Not a single step!</i>

15:00.566 --> 15:04.737
You used the same move twice against me...

15:08.365 --> 15:09.491
<i>"Insolent."</i>

15:10.451 --> 15:12.703
<i>I'm pretty sure I heard that word...</i>

15:13.662 --> 15:14.496
<i>I think.</i>

15:16.165 --> 15:21.879
<i>Though Japanese, Kenichi Sawai was known
as an extraordinary kung fu expert.</i>

15:21.962 --> 15:25.090
<i>These were his words.</i>

15:26.800 --> 15:29.178
<i>"If you swung your arm
with the same limberness</i>

15:29.261 --> 15:31.430
<i>as a baseball pitcher throwing a pitch,</i>

15:32.014 --> 15:36.143
<i>and it struck your opponent in the face,
it would cause incredible damage."</i>

15:37.227 --> 15:39.688
<i>The eyes and nose
would be struck at once,</i>

15:39.772 --> 15:43.275
<i>and your opponent's eyes would water
so much that they couldn't see."</i>

16:00.250 --> 16:02.127
Did he fly from over there?

16:02.211 --> 16:03.754
That's over ten meters!

16:10.052 --> 16:11.345
He's coming this way!

16:30.447 --> 16:31.699
<i>Ogre.</i>

16:35.703 --> 16:37.204
<i>Ya know, Ogre...</i>

16:41.166 --> 16:43.252
<i>I'm happy for you, hey.</i>

16:47.798 --> 16:50.217
<i>Your dream has come true.</i>

17:02.438 --> 17:05.858
<i>You loved, and loved,</i>

17:06.692 --> 17:08.444
<i>and yearned.</i>

17:09.319 --> 17:12.614
<i>You raised and nurtured,</i>

17:13.991 --> 17:17.870
<i>and now the day has come.</i>

17:18.746 --> 17:20.622
<i>I'm a little jealous.</i>

17:22.499 --> 17:24.960
<i>Whether it was his biological reaction
to the damage</i>

17:25.044 --> 17:27.129
<i>or his dismay at his own powerlessness,</i>

17:28.505 --> 17:30.466
<i>with endless tears pouring down his face,</i>

17:30.549 --> 17:33.886
<i>the young man could only silently
come to this conclusion.</i>

17:34.595 --> 17:36.638
<i>This was no time for a father-son fight.</i>

17:39.266 --> 17:40.642
<i>He had to battle him.</i>

17:52.237 --> 17:53.363
He stood up!

18:13.675 --> 18:16.428
Okay, let's do this.

18:23.268 --> 18:25.437
Wait. His bleeding's stopped.

18:28.357 --> 18:30.317
<i>When a fighter is bleeding in the ring,</i>

18:31.026 --> 18:33.695
<i>a hemostat is used as first aid.</i>

18:34.196 --> 18:37.825
<i>But there is a surefire method
even more effective at stopping bleeding.</i>

18:38.909 --> 18:40.911
<i>It is the determination to fight.</i>

18:41.995 --> 18:46.667
<i>A powerful will to fight
stimulates the secretion of adrenalin.</i>

18:47.793 --> 18:50.337
<i>There is nothing more effective
at stopping bleeding.</i>

18:51.004 --> 18:55.175
<i>There are real examples of gifted seconds
purposefully provoking their fighters</i>

18:55.259 --> 18:59.221
<i>and firing up their fighting spirit
to stop the bleeding.</i>

19:00.264 --> 19:03.225
So, I see you haven't given up yet.

19:04.977 --> 19:05.811
Given up?

19:07.604 --> 19:08.814
Don't be ridiculous.

19:38.844 --> 19:40.387
<i>I'm happy for you.</i>

19:41.096 --> 19:43.515
<i>I'm happy for you, Baki.</i>

19:44.683 --> 19:46.018
<i>Have him play with you.</i>

19:46.810 --> 19:49.021
<i>Have him play with you
to your heart's content.</i>

19:50.230 --> 19:51.231
<i>Baki...</i>

19:57.070 --> 20:01.700
<i>There's no other father
who'd play with their child this much!</i>

20:17.090 --> 20:18.800
I owe you one.

20:18.884 --> 20:21.595
The coordination
between the Self-Defense Force

20:21.678 --> 20:23.805
and the riot police went smoothly.

20:23.889 --> 20:27.100
I believe this should keep
the ordinary citizens safe.

20:30.103 --> 20:31.813
<i>Feats that only kin could do...</i>

20:32.940 --> 20:36.026
<i>So far, he's doing excellent.</i>

20:37.611 --> 20:40.697
<i>Well, this is a combat sport though.</i>

20:48.413 --> 20:49.831
<i>Oh, I see.</i>

20:50.916 --> 20:51.833
<i>He's here.</i>

20:56.713 --> 20:57.798
<i>In that case...</i>

21:05.847 --> 21:07.140
<i>I've gotta show him.</i>

21:08.433 --> 21:12.104
<i>I know you'll be able to, with your eyes.</i>

21:22.864 --> 21:25.367
<i>With your vision,
I'm sure you'll be able to see.</i>

21:26.535 --> 21:28.620
Why... you...

21:31.957 --> 21:35.877
<i>A talented</i> shokeiken <i>practitioner
can make visible...</i>

21:36.878 --> 21:38.088
<i>the beast they mimic.</i>

21:38.797 --> 21:40.799
<i>They can make its form visible.</i>

21:42.884 --> 21:45.512
<i>The spectators clearly saw</i>

21:46.930 --> 21:49.766
<i>a sight they'd never seen before.</i>

21:51.435 --> 21:55.355
<i>The form of the T-Rex's greatest rival.</i>

22:00.110 --> 22:05.032
Why you goddamn devoted son of mine!

22:08.035 --> 22:09.036
<i>At this time...</i>

22:11.580 --> 22:15.042
<i>Someone was watching
this father-son fight.</i>

22:16.376 --> 22:18.920
<i>Someone with eyesight
much better than 20/20.</i>
